        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG110, Stainless Steel Abbeyville Lever Pair</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe AHI made SIG110 has a square flat grip which mounts at a 90 degree angle. This is a great addition to match other modern hardware in your home. The lever is all stainless steel, making it extremely resistant to corrosion, knocks, scratches and abrasions\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the SIG110 Abbeyville Stainless Steel Lever Pair:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5.12\" (130 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Lever Style: flat</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2.17\" (55 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Spindle Width: 0.31\" (8 mm)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Includes pair of levers with spindle only.  Rose, latch, strike and faceplate sold separately.</b>\r\n</p>",
